C8  / today-weight: role=img, 30 data rows in 3 columns
C8      title: Weight, the last 30 days
C8      desc:  Daily readings as unconnected dots, the seven-day average as the solid line, and the goal trajectory dashed inside its corridor. Days with no reading are hatched and are never joined up.
C8  / today-waist: role=img, 30 data rows in 3 columns
C8      title: Waist, the last 30 days
C8      desc:  Waist measurements, joined between the readings that exist. A tape measure is used about once a week by one person in one place, so two readings a week apart are two comparable measurements and are drawn joined; nothing between them is invented.
C8  /health health-body: role=img, 30 data rows in 3 columns
C8      title: Weight and waist, the last 30 days
C8      desc:  Weight above and waist below, on one time axis. Weight carries its seven-day average and the goal trajectory; waist is measured by hand and is drawn as the readings it has. The days the scale went quiet are hatched in both bands.
C8  /health health-steps: role=img, 30 data rows in 3 columns
C8      title: Steps, the last 30 days
C8      desc:  One bar per day. A day the phone sent nothing has no bar and is hatched, never a bar of zero.
C8  /health health-sleep: role=img, 30 data rows in 3 columns
C8      title: Sleep, the last 30 nights
C8      desc:  One bar per night. A night the watch did not record has no bar and is hatched, never a bar of zero.
C8  /health health-heart: role=img, 30 data rows in 3 columns
C8      title: Resting heart rate, the last 30 days
C8      desc:  Resting heart rate, one point per reading, joined only between the readings that exist.
